      "description": "A gigantic man-eating shark that has been alive for a very long time. They are the largest among all the sharks confirmed, and can easily swallow a human whole. They were believed to have gone extinct, but there have been giant shark sightings reported, and upon further review, it was determined that those were indeed megalodons. How they were able to survive and why they were suddenly starting to appear is unknown."
